id: pm-jira-edv0
title: Eliminate the last source any with real SDK handler context types
description: "Replace the 5 remaining source any annotations on SDK handler contexts in index.ts (preflight, two importers, exporter, onWrite hook) with the real SDK context types from @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/authoring, imported type-only from the same subpath the file already imports ExtensionApi from so standalone installs gain no runtime module edge."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-27T22:02:20.644Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-27T22:03:06.065Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-27T22:03:06.064Z"
author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: "No any remains in index.ts (grep for : any | as any | <any> | any[] prints nothing); npm run build, npm test, and npx tsc --noEmit all pass; changelog:check reports up to date; pm jira --help lists all subcommands and pm list/health stay intact after install (real activation proof); behaviour unchanged (typing refactor only)."
resolution: "Replaced (1) registerPreflight ctx:any -> PreflightOverrideContext, (2) registerImporter jira ctx:any -> ImportExportContext, (3) registerImporter jira-sync ctx:any -> ImportExportContext, (4) registerExporter jira ctx:any -> ImportExportContext, (5) hooks.onWrite hookCtx:any -> OnWriteHookContext. Imported type-only from the same subpath the file already imports ExtensionApi from, so standalone installs gain no runtime module edge. Preflight defensive optional-chaining/?? fallbacks retained as no-ops with an explanatory comment; decidePushOnWrite runtime guard kept (OnWriteHookContext flows through with no cast). No enum/namespace/import= used; erasable TypeScript only."
expected_result: "Zero any in index.ts; npm run build, npm test (78), and npx tsc --noEmit pass; changelog:check up to date; pm jira --help lists all subcommands and pm list/health stay intact after install."
actual_result: "grep for : any | as any | <any> | any[] on index.ts prints nothing. npm run build exit 0; npm test 78 pass / 0 fail; npx tsc --noEmit exit 0; changelog:check printed 'Changelog is up to date'. Real activation proof in fresh /tmp/pm-jira-proof: pm install activation_status ok with 5 registered commands and failed_count 0; pm jira --help lists export/import/sync/validate; pm list --json returns items []; pm health status ok."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T22:02:31.550Z",pi-agent,"SDK handler context types resolved in node_modules/@unbrained/pm-cli/dist/core/extensions/extension-types.d.ts and re-exported type-only from @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/authoring: PreflightOverrideContext (preflight, extends CommandHandlerContext + decision), ImportExportContext (importer + exporter, extends PortableWorkspaceContext with options/args/global/pm_root/sdk), OnWriteHookContext (onWrite hook, with path/scope/op/item_id/item_type/before/after/changed_fields). The 5 any sites replaced: (1) api.registerPreflight ctx: any -> PreflightOverrideContext; (2) api.registerImporter jira ctx: any -> ImportExportContext; (3) api.registerImporter jira-sync ctx: any -> ImportExportContext; (4) api.registerExporter jira ctx: any -> ImportExportContext; (5) api.hooks.onWrite hookCtx: any -> OnWriteHookContext. OnWriteHookContext is structurally assignable to decidePushOnWrite's loose {path?;scope?;op?} param, so it flows through with no cast and the runtime guard is retained. Preflight defensive optional-chaining + ?? fallbacks kept as no-ops (comment added) rather than deleted. Contract gotchas respected: --json stays on ctx.global (not ctx.options) and multi-word flags read camelCased."
  "2026-07-27T22:02:59.030Z",pi-agent,"ACTIVATION PROOF (verbatim, pm-cli 2026.7.27, fresh /tmp/pm-jira-proof): pm install reported activation_status: ok, activated: true, registered_commands: jira export, jira import, jira sync, jira validate, jira-sync import; failed_count: 0. pm jira --help (exit 0) lists Commands: export [file], import [file], sync [options], validate [options] — all subcommands present (NOT the misleading Commander arity error from pm-cli#772). pm list --json (exit 0) returns { items: [], count: 0 } — host commands intact. pm health (exit 0) reports status ok with blocking_failure_count 0. Gates: npm run build exit 0; npm test = 78 pass / 0 fail; npx tsc --noEmit exit 0; npm run changelog:check printed 'Changelog is up to date'; zero-any grep on index.ts prints nothing."
close_reason: "Typing refactor complete: the 5 remaining source any annotations on SDK handler contexts in index.ts are replaced with the real SDK context types imported type-only from @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk/authoring."
